# Everything is left out of the VSIX but what is listed below: the bundle
# carries vscode-languageclient, so no node_modules ship, and the preview's
# diagram engine is copied into dist/plantuml/ by `npm run bundle`
# (scripts/copy-plantuml.mjs). vsix-files.txt is
# the resulting list, which CI compares against. bin/ exists only while
# `npm run package:bundled` packages a binary.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/plantuml/**
!README.md
!LICENSE
!bin/rinx
!bin/rinx.exe
